#: canvas-theme-editor/README.md
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"Upload-ready assets for Canvas LMS's **Theme Editor**, plus a local preview "
"for authoring Rich\n"
"Content Editor (RCE) page templates styled with\n"
"[`@pantoken/components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/"
"components).\n"
"\n"
"## What's here\n"
"\n"
"- `theme.css` / `theme.js` — upload these two files under **Theme Editor → "
"Advanced** in Canvas.\n"
"  They're built for the CDN provider/theme/mode you chose when scaffolding "
"(`--cdn`/`--theme`/\n"
"  `--theme-mode`; jsDelivr/rebrand/light by default) and include a loader "
"for\n"
"  `@pantoken/interactions` (wires up component behaviors like modal, "
"tooltip, and drilldown).\n"
"- `index.html` / `src/main.ts` — a local, TinyMCE-based editor (`npm run "
"dev`) that mirrors Canvas's\n"
"  RCE so you can author page templates against pantoken's classes before "
"copying them into Canvas.\n"
"  The page itself is built with pantoken's `wrapper` layout: click **Edit "
"theme** to open a tray\n"
"  with **Config** / **CSS** / **JS** tabs (CDN provider/theme/mode selects, "
"and syntax-highlighted,\n"
"  hand-editable copies of `theme.css`/`theme.js` that feed the live "
"preview), and the **?** button\n"
"  for full instructions. Use the **Layouts** toolbar button to start from "
"one of pantoken's bundled\n"
"  starter page layouts (hero, callout, two-column, rubric note, "
"testimonial), sourced from\n"
"  [`@pantoken/plugin-layouts`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/"
"plugin-layouts).\n"
"\n"
"## Develop\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"This opens a Vite dev server with:\n"
"\n"
"- An **editor** pane (TinyMCE, matching the version/config\n"
"  [instructure/canvas-lms](https://github.com/instructure/canvas-lms) itself "
"uses — see below).\n"
"  Use the **Layouts** button to load one of the bundled starter layouts "
"(this replaces the whole\n"
"  document, after a confirm, rather than inserting at the cursor), and the "
"**Source code** toggle\n"
"  to hand-edit the raw HTML in a syntax-highlighted (CodeMirror) view "
"alongside the editor, with\n"
"  the preview pane updating live as you type — unlike TinyMCE's stock `code` "
"plugin, which edits in\n"
"  a one-shot modal dialog with no live preview.\n"
"- A **preview** pane showing the editor's content with the current CSS/JS "
"tab's stylesheet/script\n"
"  applied (not just the resolved CDN URLs), wrapped to match Canvas's own "
"content-area background\n"
"  and max width — a faithful \"what this will look like once uploaded to "
"Canvas\" check, updated\n"
"  live as you type or edit the theme.\n"
"- The editor and preview panes sit in a split view you can resize by "
"dragging the divider, stack\n"
"  vertically instead of side by side, and swap the order of (drag a pane's "
"toolbar onto the other,\n"
"  or use the **Swap panes** button). Each pane has its own fullscreen "
"button.\n"
"- The **Edit theme** tray's **Config** tab holds the CDN provider/theme/mode "
"selects and\n"
"  **Download theme.css** / **Download theme.js** links; its **CSS**/**JS** "
"tabs are editable copies\n"
"  of the generated files — hand-edit them and the preview picks up your "
"changes directly. Changing\n"
"  a Config select re-generates the CSS/JS tabs unless you've already edited "
"them, in which case a\n"
"  **Regenerate from config** button appears instead of silently overwriting "
"your edit.\n"
"\n"
"## Workflow\n"
"\n"
"1. Upload `theme.css` and `theme.js` to Canvas's Theme Editor (**Advanced → "
"CSS / JavaScript**) so\n"
"   pantoken's classes are available on every page.\n"
"2. Run `npm run dev`, use **Layouts** to start from a bundled starter, and "
"edit it like you\n"
"   would in Canvas's own RCE.\n"
"3. Click **Copy HTML** and paste the result into a Canvas page's RCE (switch "
"to the HTML editor\n"
"   view first). Canvas sanitizes pasted HTML server-side — this scaffold "
"doesn't attempt to\n"
"   replicate that, so always verify the pasted result in Canvas (see \"Notes "
"on Canvas's RCE\"\n"
"   below).\n"
"\n"
"## Notes on Canvas's RCE\n"
"\n"
"The Canvas Rich Content Editor runs TinyMCE and sanitizes submitted HTML on "
"the server against an\n"
"allowlist (`gems/canvas_sanitize` in canvas-lms, kept in sync with TinyMCE's "
"own\n"
"`valid_elements`/`extended_valid_elements`). What that allowlist means for "
"templates built here:\n"
"\n"
"- `class`, `id`, `style`, `title`, `role`, and `aria-*` attributes are "
"allowed on every element —\n"
"  pantoken's `class=\"instui-*\"` styling hooks (and inline `style`, e.g. "
"for CSS anchor positioning)\n"
"  **do** survive being pasted and saved, contrary to older guidance in this "
"file. `<script>` tags\n"
"  are always stripped.\n"
"- **RCE-safe pantoken components**: static/display components — alert, view, "
"heading, text, table,\n"
"  a button-as-`<a>` (not a real `<button>`), blockquote. Stick to semantic "
"HTML pantoken already\n"
"  supports (`div`, `p`, `span`, `a`, `img`, headings, lists, tables).\n"
"- **RCE-unsafe**: anything from `@pantoken/interactions`'s behavior set — "
"modal, tooltip,\n"
"  drilldown, close-button, or any other component driven by the native "
"`popover`/`popovertarget`/\n"
"  `command`/`commandfor` attributes. Those attributes aren't in Canvas's "
"sanitizer allowlist, so\n"
"  the markup survives but the interactive behavior silently breaks the first "
"time the page is\n"
"  saved in Canvas, even with `theme.js`'s `@pantoken/interactions` loader "
"present. Real form\n"
"  elements (`input`, `form`, `button`, `select`, `textarea`, `label`) and "
"inline `<svg>` are\n"
"  stripped outright — none of the bundled starter templates use them.\n"
"\n"
"`theme.js` loads `@pantoken/interactions` from the CDN, which runs in "
"Canvas's global page scope —\n"
"useful for interactions on pages you build directly in Canvas's RCE with raw "
"HTML edits, but (per\n"
"above) any `popover`/`command`-attribute-driven markup pasted from the RCE "
"preview here won't stay\n"
"interactive once saved.\n"
msgstr ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"Aset siap muat untuk **Theme Editor** Canvas LMS, ditambah pratonton lokal "
"untuk menyusun templat halaman Rich Content Editor (RCE) yang bergaya "
"dengan\n"
"[`@pantoken/components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/"
"components).\n"
"\n"
"## Apa yang ada di sini\n"
"\n"
"- `theme.css` / `theme.js` — muat dua fail ini di bawah **Theme Editor → "
"Advanced** dalam Canvas.\n"
"  Ia dibina untuk penyedia CDN/tema/mod yang anda pilih semasa perancaan (`--"
"cdn`/`--theme`/\n"
"  `--theme-mode`; jsDelivr/rebrand/light secara lalai) dan merangkumi pemuat "
"untuk\n"
"  `@pantoken/interactions` (menghubungkan perilaku komponen seperti modal, "
"tooltip, dan drilldown).\n"
"- `index.html` / `src/main.ts` — editor berasaskan TinyMCE lokal (`npm run "
"dev`) yang mencerminkan RCE Canvas supaya anda dapat menyusun templat "
"halaman mengikut kelas pantoken sebelum menyalinnya ke Canvas.\n"
"  Halaman itu sendiri dibina dengan susunatur `wrapper` pantoken: klik "
"**Edit tema** untuk membuka baki dengan tab **Config** / **CSS** / **JS** "
"(pilih penyedia CDN/tema/mod, dan salinan diserlahkan sintaks, boleh "
"disunting tangan bagi `theme.css`/`theme.js` yang membekalkan pratonton "
"langsung), dan butang **?** untuk arahan lengkap. Gunakan butang bar alat "
"**Layouts** untuk memulai daripada salah satu susunatur halaman permulaan "
"pantoken yang disekumpul (hero, callout, dua-lajur, nota rubrik, testimoni), "
"bersumber dari\n"
"  [`@pantoken/plugin-layouts`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/"
"plugin-layouts).\n"
"\n"
"## Bangun\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Ini membuka pelayan dev Vite dengan:\n"
"\n"
"- Anak tetingkap **editor** (TinyMCE, sepadan dengan versi/config\n"
"  [instructure/canvas-lms](https://github.com/instructure/canvas-lms) yang "
"digunakan sendiri — lihat di bawah).\n"
"  Gunakan butang **Layouts** untuk memuatkan salah satu susunatur permulaan "
"yang disekumpul (ini menggantikan keseluruhan dokumen, selepas pengesahan, "
"daripada memasukkan di kursor), dan togol **Source code** untuk menyunting "
"tangan HTML mentah dalam pandangan diserlahkan sintaks (CodeMirror) bersama "
"editor, dengan anak tetingkap pratonton mengemas kini langsung semasa anda "
"menaip — tidak seperti pemalam stok `code` TinyMCE, yang menyunting dalam "
"dialog modal satu kali tanpa pratonton langsung.\n"
"- Anak tetingkap **pratonton** menunjukkan kandungan editor dengan "
"stylesheet/skrip tab CSS/JS semasa yang digunakan (bukan hanya URL CDN yang "
"diselesaikan), dibungkus untuk sepadan dengan latar belakang kawasan "
"kandungan Canvas sendiri dan lebar maksimum — pemeriksaan setia \"bagaimana "
"ini akan kelihatan apabila dimuat ke Canvas\", dikemas kini langsung semasa "
"anda menaip atau menyunting tema.\n"
"- Anak tetingkap editor dan pratonton berada dalam pandangan berpecah yang "
"anda boleh ubah saiz dengan menyeret pembahagi, tindih secara menegak "
"daripada berdampingan, dan tukar susunan (seret bar alat anak tetingkap ke "
"yang lain, atau gunakan butang **Swap panes**). Setiap anak tetingkap "
"mempunyai butang skrin penuh sendiri.\n"
"- Tab **Config** baki **Edit tema** memegang pilihan penyedia CDN/tema/mod "
"dan pautan **Download theme.css** / **Download theme.js**; tab **CSS**/"
"**JS** nya adalah salinan boleh sedia dari fail yang dijana — suntinglah "
"tangan dan pratonton mengambil perubahan anda secara langsung. Menukar "
"pilihan Config menjana semula tab CSS/JS melainkan anda telah menyuntingnya, "
"dalam hal ini butang **Regenerate from config** muncul daripada senyap "
"menimpa suntingan anda.\n"
"\n"
"## Aliran kerja\n"
"\n"
"1. Muat `theme.css` dan `theme.js` ke Theme Editor Canvas (**Advanced → "
"CSS / JavaScript**) supaya kelas pantoken tersedia di setiap halaman.\n"
"2. Jalankan `npm run dev`, gunakan **Layouts** untuk memulai daripada "
"permulaan yang disekumpul, dan suntingnya seperti anda akan lakukan dalam "
"RCE Canvas sendiri.\n"
"3. Klik **Copy HTML** dan tampal keputusannya ke RCE halaman Canvas (tukar "
"ke pandangan editor HTML terlebih dahulu). Canvas membersihkan HTML yang "
"ditampal sisi pelayan — perancaan ini tidak cuba untuk mengulangi itu, jadi "
"sentiasa sahkan keputusan yang ditampal dalam Canvas (lihat \"Nota tentang "
"RCE Canvas\" di bawah).\n"
"\n"
"## Nota tentang RCE Canvas\n"
"\n"
"Rich Content Editor Canvas menjalankan TinyMCE dan membersihkan HTML yang "
"dikemukakan di pelayan terhadap senarai putih (`gems/canvas_sanitize` dalam "
"canvas-lms, disimpan dalam sinkron dengan `valid_elements`/"
"`extended_valid_elements` TinyMCE sendiri). Apa yang bermaksud senarai putih "
"itu untuk templat yang dibina di sini:\n"
"\n"
"- Atribut `class`, `id`, `style`, `title`, `role`, dan `aria-*` dibenarkan "
"pada setiap elemen — cangkuk gaya `class=\"instui-*\"` pantoken (dan `style` "
"sebaris, cth. untuk kedudukan sauh CSS) **benar-benar** bertahan ditampal "
"dan disimpan, bertentangan dengan panduan yang lebih lama dalam fail ini. "
"Tag `<script>` sentiasa dilucutkan.\n"
"- **Komponen pantoken selamat RCE**: komponen statik/paparan — amaran, "
"pandangan, tajuk, teks, jadual, butang-sebagai-`<a>` (bukan `<button>` "
"sebenar), blok kutipan. Kekal kepada HTML semantik yang pantoken sudah "
"sokong (`div`, `p`, `span`, `a`, `img`, tajuk, senarai, jadual).\n"
"- **RCE-tidak selamat**: apa-apa daripada set perilaku `@pantoken/"
"interactions` — modal, tooltip, drilldown, butang-tutup, atau komponen lain "
"yang didorong oleh atribut `popover`/`popovertarget`/`command`/`commandfor` "
"asli. Atribut tersebut tidak berada dalam senarai putih pembersih Canvas, "
"jadi penanda bertahan tetapi perilaku interaktif senyap-senyap pecah kali "
"pertama halaman disimpan dalam Canvas, walaupun pemuat `@pantoken/"
"interactions` `theme.js` hadir. Elemen borang sebenar (`input`, `form`, "
"`button`, `select`, `textarea`, `label`) dan `<svg>` sebaris dilucutkan "
"sepenuhnya — tiada satu pun templat permulaan yang disekumpul "
"menggunakannya.\n"
"\n"
"`theme.js` memuatkan `@pantoken/interactions` daripada CDN, yang berjalan "
"dalam skop halaman global Canvas — berguna untuk interaksi pada halaman yang "
"anda bina secara langsung dalam RCE Canvas dengan suntingan HTML mentah, "
"tetapi (seperti di atas) mana-mana penanda yang didorong atribut `popover`/"
"`command` yang ditampal daripada pratonton RCE di sini tidak akan kekal "
"interaktif apabila disimpan.\n"

#: components/README.md
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"A plain TypeScript app (via Vite) styled with\n"
"[`@pantoken/components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/"
"components), Instructure's\n"
"design tokens and icons.\n"
"\n"
"## Develop\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## What's here\n"
"\n"
"- `index.html` holds the actual page markup — a `wrapper`-layout shell from\n"
"  [`@pantoken/plugin-layouts`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/"
"plugin-layouts). View source\n"
"  and edit it directly; nothing is injected by JavaScript.\n"
"- `src/main.ts` imports `@pantoken/css` (defines every `--instui-*` custom "
"property),\n"
"  `@pantoken/components/base.css` (document defaults + focus ring), "
"`components.css`\n"
"  (`.instui-*` classes), `@pantoken/interactions` (wires up modal, tooltip, "
"and other component\n"
"  behaviors out of the box), and your own `src/style.css` — add interactive "
"behavior here.\n"
"- Optional insertion points (header, filters, content, trailing) are marked "
"with\n"
"  `<div data-slot=\"...\">` in `index.html` — replace their contents with "
"your own markup.\n"
"- Apply classes like `class=\"instui-button\"` to markup; see the\n"
"  [component reference](https://pantoken.app/api/css) for the full class "
"list.\n"
"\n"
"## Learn more\n"
"\n"
"See the [HTML guide](https://pantoken.app/guide/components) to learn more.\n"
msgstr ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"Aplikasi TypeScript biasa (melalui Vite) dengan gaya\n"
"[`@pantoken/components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/"
"components), token desain dan ikon Instructure.\n"
"\n"
"## Kembangkan\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## Apa yang ada di sini\n"
"\n"
"- `index.html` berisi markup halaman yang sebenarnya — cangkang tata letak "
"`wrapper` dari\n"
"  [`@pantoken/plugin-layouts`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/"
"plugin-layouts). Lihat sumber\n"
"  dan edit langsung; tidak ada yang disuntikkan oleh JavaScript.\n"
"- `src/main.ts` mengimpor `@pantoken/css` (mendefinisikan setiap properti "
"khusus `--instui-*`),\n"
"  `@pantoken/components/base.css` (default dokumen + cincin fokus), "
"`components.css`\n"
"  (kelas `.instui-*`), `@pantoken/interactions` (menghubungkan modal, "
"tooltip, dan perilaku komponen lain secara langsung), dan milik Anda sendiri "
"`src/style.css` — tambahkan perilaku interaktif di sini.\n"
"- Titik penyisipan opsional (header, filter, konten, trailing) ditandai "
"dengan\n"
"  `<div data-slot=\"...\">` di `index.html` — ganti isinya dengan markup "
"Anda sendiri.\n"
"- Terapkan kelas seperti `class=\"instui-button\"` ke markup; lihat\n"
"  [referensi komponen](https://pantoken.app/api/css) untuk daftar kelas "
"lengkap.\n"
"\n"
"## Pelajari lebih lanjut\n"
"\n"
"Lihat [panduan HTML](https://pantoken.app/guide/components) untuk "
"mempelajari lebih lanjut.\n"

#: next/README.md
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"A Next.js (App Router) app styled with [`@pantoken/next`](https://"
"www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/next),\n"
"Instructure's design tokens and icons.\n"
"\n"
"## Develop\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## What's here\n"
"\n"
"- `next.config.mjs` wraps the config with `withPantoken(...)` (adds pantoken "
"to\n"
"  `transpilePackages`).\n"
"- `app/layout.tsx` imports `@pantoken/css`, which defines every `--instui-*` "
"custom\n"
"  property, at the root so it's available on every page, plus the `wrapper` "
"layout's root class on\n"
"  `<body>` and `PantokenInteractions` (a client component that loads "
"`@pantoken/interactions` —\n"
"  wires up modal, tooltip, and other component behaviors out of the box).\n"
"- `app/page.tsx` renders markup styled with `instui-*` classes; optional "
"insertion points (header,\n"
"  filters, content, trailing) are marked with `<div data-slot=\"...\">`.\n"
"\n"
"## Learn more\n"
"\n"
"See the [getting started guide](https://pantoken.app/guide/getting-started) "
"to learn more.\n"
msgstr ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"Aplikasi Next.js (App Router) yang ditata dengan [`@pantoken/next`](https://"
"www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/next),\n"
"token desain dan ikon Instructure.\n"
"\n"
"## Berkembang\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## Apa yang ada di sini\n"
"\n"
"- `next.config.mjs` membungkus konfigurasi dengan `withPantoken(...)` "
"(menambahkan pantoken ke\n"
"  `transpilePackages`).\n"
"- `app/layout.tsx` mengimpor `@pantoken/css`, yang mendefinisikan setiap `--"
"instui-*` properti kustom,\n"
"  pada root sehingga tersedia di setiap halaman, ditambah kelas root tata "
"letak `wrapper` pada\n"
"  `<body>` dan `PantokenInteractions` (komponen klien yang memuat `@pantoken/"
"interactions` —\n"
"  mengatur modal, tooltip, dan perilaku komponen lain siap pakai).\n"
"- `app/page.tsx` merender markup yang ditata dengan kelas `instui-*`; titik "
"penyisipan opsional (header,\n"
"  filter, konten, trailing) ditandai dengan `<div data-slot=\"...\">`.\n"
"\n"
"## Pelajari lebih lanjut\n"
"\n"
"Lihat [panduan memulai](https://pantoken.app/guide/getting-started) untuk "
"mempelajari lebih lanjut.\n"

