#: web-components/README.md
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"A plain TypeScript app (via Vite) styled with\n"
"[`@pantoken/components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/components) "
"and using\n"
"framework-agnostic custom elements from\n"
"[`@pantoken/web-components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/web-"
"components).\n"
"\n"
"## Develop\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## What's here\n"
"\n"
"- `src/main.ts` imports `@pantoken/css` (defines every `--instui-*` custom "
"property),\n"
"  `@pantoken/components/base.css` + `components.css` (`.instui-*` classes),\n"
"  `@pantoken/interactions` (wires up modal, tooltip, and other component "
"behaviors out of the\n"
"  box), and `@pantoken/web-components` (auto-registers elements like "
"`<instui-icon>`), then\n"
"  renders markup into `#app`.\n"
"- Optional insertion points (header, filters, content, trailing) are marked "
"with\n"
"  `<div data-slot=\"...\">` — replace their contents with your own markup.\n"
"- Use custom elements directly in markup, e.g. `<instui-button>`, `<instui-"
"alert variant=\"success\">` —\n"
"  see the [`@pantoken/web-components` README](https://www.npmjs.com/package/"
"@pantoken/web-components)\n"
"  for the full element list.\n"
"\n"
"## Learn more\n"
"\n"
"See the [HTML guide](https://pantoken.app/guide/components) to learn more.\n"
msgstr ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"Aplikasi TypeScript biasa (melalui Vite) yang bergaya dengan\n"
"[`@pantoken/components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/components) "
"dan menggunakan\n"
"elemen kustom yang agnostik kerangka kerja dari\n"
"[`@pantoken/web-components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/web-"
"components).\n"
"\n"
"## Kembangkan\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## Apa yang ada di sini\n"
"\n"
"- `src/main.ts` mengimpor `@pantoken/css` (mendefinisikan setiap properti "
"kustom `--instui-*`),\n"
"  `@pantoken/components/base.css` + `components.css` (kelas `.instui-*`),\n"
"  `@pantoken/interactions` (menghubungkan modal, tooltip, dan perilaku "
"komponen lain langsung),\n"
"  dan `@pantoken/web-components` (mendaftarkan otomatis elemen seperti "
"`<instui-icon>`), kemudian\n"
"  merender markup ke `#app`.\n"
"- Titik penyisipan opsional (header, penyaring, konten, tertinggal) ditandai "
"dengan\n"
"  `<div data-slot=\"...\">` — ganti konten mereka dengan markup Anda "
"sendiri.\n"
"- Gunakan elemen kustom langsung dalam markup, misalnya `<instui-button>`, "
"`<instui-alert variant=\"success\">` —\n"
"  lihat [README `@pantoken/web-components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/"
"@pantoken/web-components)\n"
"  untuk daftar elemen lengkap.\n"
"\n"
"## Pelajari lebih lanjut\n"
"\n"
"Lihat [panduan HTML](https://pantoken.app/guide/components) untuk "
"mempelajari lebih lanjut.\n"
